──────────────────── Turn 11 · Quarterly energy allocation ─────────────────────
                          Month 3 · Quarter 1 · Year 1                          

A new quarter begins and you have 3 Energy points. Unused Energy does not roll  
over. Plan your energy actions: you can combine several, as long as the total   
cost is no more than 3, and you can leave some or all of your Energy unused. The
system applies each chosen action’s status_updates to your visible stats.       

