but you are tired in the short term.
      [3] Network maintenance — Keep up relationships inside and outside the 
team. Network and Dignity rise slightly.
      [4] Defuse legacy risk — Clear up old problems before they bite. 
HiddenRisk goes down.
      [5] Mental recovery — Take time to reset. Dignity gets a solid boost.
      [6] Health recovery — Rest and recover. Health gets a solid boost.
  >>> [7] Prepare report materials — Write up your visible wins early. Output 
and Dignity rise a little.
      [8] Reserve energy (no action) — Leave the rest of your Energy unused this
quarter. It does not roll over.

